id: pm-context-zwf1
title: Keep CodeQL actions versioned and updated as one unit
description: "CodeQL init and analyze must use the same release, but Dependabot currently opens separate updates that cannot pass independently. Bump every CodeQL action reference together and group future GitHub Actions updates for github/codeql-action."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-30T15:38:18.740Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-30T15:40:54.063Z"
closed_at: "2026-08-30T15:40:54.054Z"
completed_at: "2026-08-30T15:40:54.054Z"
claim_principal: pi-agent
author: pi-agent
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-30T15:39:45.403Z",pi-agent,"Updated init and analyze to the 4.37.9 commit cdf488f595d80d6e07e03d4674febd5ab45fa938, added the Dependabot codeql-action group, and added regression coverage. npm test passed 297 tests; npm run coverage passed at 100% statements, branches, functions, and lines; npm run docstring passed 47 of 47 declarations. Regression proof: replacing the fixed workflow SHA with the prior 4.37.8 SHA made test/codeql-action-sync.test.ts fail with exit 1, then restoring the fix made both tests pass."
files[3]{path,scope}:
  .github/dependabot.yml,project
  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project
  test/codeql-action-sync.test.ts,project
tests[3]{command,scope,provenance{author,created_at,source_kind,source_ref}}:
  npm test,project,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T15:39:43.327Z",local_mutation,chore/bump-pm-changelog-to-2026-8-30
  npm run coverage,project,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T15:39:44.067Z",local_mutation,chore/bump-pm-changelog-to-2026-8-30
  npm run docstring,project,pi-agent,"2026-08-30T15:39:44.696Z",local_mutation,chore/bump-pm-changelog-to-2026-8-30
close_reason: "CodeQL init and analyze now use 4.37.9 together, future updates are grouped, and regression tests enforce both contracts."
